          "code": "USA and Florida hotels - Check in Minimum age policy",
          "description": "USA and Florida hotels - Check in Minimum age policy",
          "note": "Please note; Most hotels across USA require a minimum check in age of \n21 years for each room booked.  \nYou will be asked to provide identification upon check-in.",
